This is a monorepo for data collection and processing.

## Scrapers (./scrapers/)
- Python with uv (use `uv add` for packages, never pip)
- Scrapy for scraping
- MongoDB for data storage
- Apache Airflow for scheduling (DAGs in ./scrapers/dags/)

## Conventions
- Spiders go in ./scrapers/spiders/, one spider per source
- DAGs in ./scrapers/dags/ orchestrate spider runs
- Credentials come from environment variables only — never hardcoded
- Use `uv run` to execute scripts
